  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Operation Welcome: Safeguarding essential humanitarian assistance for Migrants and Refugees in Roraima</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">&#x200b;&#x200b;The overall objective of the project is to preserve IOM&#x2019;s operational capacity in Roraima and ensure the continuity of essential humanitarian services for migrants, refugees, and host communities under Operation Welcome. Rather than expanding the scope of operations, the project focuses on sustaining key interventions that remain vital to the humanitarian response.</narrative>
  </description>
